# qmldir — QML module manifest. Lists the types exposed by this
# directory. The FormulaBar.qml lives in `../build/` (regenerated by
# scripts/build.sh); the relative path here pulls it into the
# `qml` module so main.qml can `import "qml"` and reference
# FormulaBar directly.
#
# Why not put qmldir alongside FormulaBar.qml in build/? The repo's
# top-level .gitignore excludes any directory named `build/`, so
# qmldir would be lost. Splitting the manifest into a tracked
# directory (qml/) and the generated artifacts into the ignored
# build/ keeps both well-behaved under version control.
module qml
FormulaBar 1.0 ../build/FormulaBar.qml
FormulaBarTouch 1.0 ../build/FormulaBarTouch.qml
Grid 1.0 ../build/Grid.qml
